    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa waenderera kugomba achiamba, “Mendzani Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na kuhenda gosi anagokulondani muhende. Gbwirani masharutige, shariyaze na amurize siku zosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambukirani vivi rero vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyokutiyani adabu, arivyokuonyesani ukuluwe, nguvuze na uwezowe mkpwulu wa kuterya. Mana sikagomba na ana enu ambao taayaona wala kusikira gosi arigohenda Mwenyezi Mlungu, ela nagomba na mwimwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kutsama 7:8—12:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tambukirani isharaze na vilinjevye arigohenda hiko Misiri kpwa mfalume wa Misiri na tsiiye yosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 14:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "msiyale arigohendera jeshi ra Misiri, farasi aho na magari gao ga kuvwehwa ni farasi, vira arivyohosa jeshi hiro kpwenye Bahari Ya Shamu ririphokala rinakulungani, na vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyoangamiza jeshi hiro hadi hivi rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya tambukirani vira Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyokuhenderani hiko jangbwani hadi mchifika hipha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 16:31–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mambo arigohendera Dathani na Abiramu, ana a Eliabu, mwana wa Rubini, vira arizi irivyofwenuka matsoni pha atu osi a Iziraeli na kuamiza phamwenga na jamaa zao, mahema gao, nyama aho osi na atumishi aho osi ariokala moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana matso genu gaona mahendo gosi makulu ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu wahenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
