            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.3+JOS.1.4+JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 1:3–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila phatu mndiphovyoga phandakala phenu. Tsi yenu indaandzira jangbwa ra uphande wa mwakani hadi kpwenye myango ya Lebanoni uphande wa vurini, na kula muho Yufurati uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa hadi kpwenye Bahari Kulu uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taphana mutu yeyesi ndiyeweza kukuturyani. Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andaahenda atu akuogopheni phophosi mndiphophiya kpwenye tsi iyo dza vira arivyokulagani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lolani, hino rero naika baraka na lana mbere zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraka napho mundalunga amuri za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, ambazo ninakuphani hivi rero; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na lana napho tamundalunga amuri za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu au kuricha njira ninazokuamuruni na kulunga milungu yanjina ambayo kala tamuimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 27:11–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.33+JOS.8.34+JOS.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 8:33–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu ndiphokufisani kpwenye tsi munayophiya kpwendaimiliki, mundatangaza baraka kula mwango Gerizimu na lana kula mwango Ebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Myango hino i ngʼambo ya muho Joridani, uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa wa njira kulu ya kuelekeya uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa wa tsi ya Akanani anaoishi Araba kulolana na Giligali kanda ya mihi yiihwayo mialoni, ya More.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi mu phephi muvuke muho Joridani muinjire kumiliki tsi ambayo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, anakuphani. Phahi ndiphoimiliki na kusagala mumo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakikishani munalunga shariya zosi na malagizo ambago nakuphani rero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
